# A page that handles its own action failures

## Component App
State:
    Let why be "none".
Actions:
    When an action fails (e: Text):
        Set why to e.
    To boom:
        Set why to "ran".
        Let bad be item 9 of [1, 2].
View:
    <p id="w">{why}</p><button id="b" on-click={boom}>b</button>

## Test: a failure reaches the page's handler
    Mount App.
    Click "#b".
    Expect that the text of "#w" is not equal to "none".
